      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "起跑后的一段时间，\n大鸣大放像屏住呼吸一般并不起眼，\n但是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "71c92a7dd0bb3040c09b75e6c2de675c790fd58b7e657c3bca1058f068a02bb8",
